# the beat flash follows the sequencer's clock, and never flashes faster than three times a second: above 180 BPM
# every second beat (the internal tempo, and an external MIDI clock's)
wait 300
expect page Steps
bpm 120
tap PLAY
wait 2000
# 120 BPM: a flash a beat (the downbeat's, then three), the fifth beat just coming
expect flashes >3
expect flashes <6
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect flash 0
bpm 240
tap PLAY
wait 2000
# 240 BPM: 8 beats in two seconds, a flash on every second (4 or 5)
expect flashes >7
expect flashes <11
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect flash 0
# an external clock (24 a beat, 21 ms apart: 119 BPM): a beat each 504 ms
midi USB FA
clock 96 21
expect playing 1
expect flashes >11
expect flashes <14
midi USB FC
clock 10 21
expect playing 0
expect flash 0
# and a clock at 250 BPM, 10 ms apart: every second beat again
midi USB FA
clock 192 10
expect flashes >14
expect flashes <19
midi USB FC
wait 100
expect flash 0
